{
  "title": "Prealgebra 2e (OpenStax)",
  "originalText": "Prealgebra is designed to meet scope and sequence requirements for a one-semester prealgebra course. The text introduces the fundamental concepts of algebra while addressing the needs of students with diverse backgrounds and learning styles. Each topic builds upon previously developed material to demonstrate the cohesiveness and structure of mathematics.\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\nFront Matter\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n1: Whole Numbers\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n2: Introduction to the Language of Algebra\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n3: Integers\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n4: Fractions\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n5: Decimals\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n6: Percents\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n7: The Properties of Real Numbers\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n8: Solving Linear Equations\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n9: Math Models and Geometry\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n10: Polynomials\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n11: Graphs\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n12: Appendix\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\nBack Matter\n\nContributors and Attributions\n\nLynn Marecek (Santa Ana College) and MaryAnne Anthony-Smith (Formerly of Santa Ana College). This content is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution License v4.0 \"Download for free at http://cnx.org/contents/fd53eae1-fa2...49835c3c@5.191.\"\n\nThis page titled Prealgebra 2e (OpenStax) was last modified on Sun, 28 May 2023 05:08:00 GMT and is shared under a CC BY  4.0  license and was authored, remixed, and/or curated by OpenStax.",
